      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The fact that this bug occurs even in isolated \"states\" makes it resemble an issue where, under a WD-off environment, using AAP (Animated Animator Parameter) with \"Interruption Source = Next\" causes behavior similar to when WD is enabled. \n\nTherefore, there is a possibility that this is a WD-dependent issue. (Though this is just a possibility…)\n\nFor reference, the avatar associated with the ID mentioned above was created with WD turned off.",
